1
00:00:00,094 --> 00:00:01,894
(Bernadette:)- Penny?
- What?

2
00:00:02,763 --> 00:00:04,693
(Sheldon:)Please don't hurt my friend.

3
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:09,027
- That is the last thing I want to do.
- Thank you.

4
00:00:11,906 --> 00:00:14,396
Coconut. What were you thinking?
Are you a hula-girl?

5
00:00:14,575 --> 00:00:15,945
Out!

6
00:00:24,585 --> 00:00:26,645
(Amy:)- Hello?
- What the hell is wrong with you?

7
00:00:26,821 --> 00:00:29,881
(Penny:)You told Sheldon? Do you know
what a terrible position this puts me in?

8
00:00:31,492 --> 00:00:33,462
(Amy:)Hang on, please.

9
00:00:34,695 --> 00:00:36,925
(Amy:)- Hello?
- Yeah, just a heads-up.

10
00:00:37,098 --> 00:00:40,898
Penny knows that you blabbed
about Leonard. She's pretty mad.

11
00:00:42,403 --> 00:00:44,963
(Amy:)I know. She's yelling at me right now.

12
00:00:45,506 --> 00:00:48,306
(Sheldon:)All right then,
so we're all on the same page.

13
00:00:53,414 --> 00:00:54,574
(Howard:)Hey, Bernie.

14
00:00:54,749 --> 00:00:55,939
(Bernadette:)There's my hubby.

15
00:00:56,117 --> 00:00:57,747
(Bernadette:)How's everything going up there?

16
00:00:57,919 --> 00:00:59,479
(Howard:)Oh, it's okay.

